      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    Wal Block Compressed\n    +----------------+----------+-------------------------------+-------------+           \n    | WalBlockHeader | raw_size | compressed WalRecords         | Padding     |           \n    +----------------+----------+-------------------------------+-------------+           \n    |<---- 16 B ---->|<-- 4 B ->|<-------- compressed_len ----->|<padding_len>|           \n                     |<-------------------- len ----------------------------->|",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    Wal Block Compressed\n    +----------------+----------+-------------------------------+-------------+                                                                   \n    | WalBlockHeader | raw_size | compressed WalRecords         | Padding     |                                                                   \n    +----------------+----------+-------------------------------+-------------+                                                                   \n    |<---- 16 B ---->|<-- 4 B ->|<-------- compressed_len ----->|<padding_len>|                                                                  \n                     |<-------------------- len ----------------------------->|",
