      "updated": 1785156851527,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| MemTable                                                 |\n|----------------------------------------------------------|\n| base_time  / valid_time_range                            |\n| bucket_dicts                                             |\n| metric_map                                               |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n                            |\n                            v\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| MetricMap                                                |\n|----------------------------------------------------------|\n| InlineSkipList<MetricMapKeyComparator>                   |\n|                                                          |\n| metric_name -> MetricObject*                             |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n                            |\n                            v\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| MetricObject                                             |\n|----------------------------------------------------------|\n| field_dict                                               |\n| series_map        : encoded_tag_set -> SeriesKey         |\n| series_keys       : series_id -> SeriesKey*              |\n| index             : optional tag filter index            |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n                            |\n                            v\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| SeriesKey                                                |\n|----------------------------------------------------------|\n| DataPointSet* + series_id + hash_code + encoded tag set  |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n                            |\n                            v\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| DataPointSet                                             |\n|----------------------------------------------------------|\n| SimpleDataPointSet or MultiFieldDataPointSet             |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| MemTable                                                 |\n|----------------------------------------------------------|\n| base_time  / valid_time_range                            |\n| bucket_dicts                                             |\n| metric_map                                               |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n                            |\n                            v\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| MetricMap                                                |\n|----------------------------------------------------------|\n| InlineSkipList<MetricMapKeyComparator>                   |\n|                                                          |\n| metric_name -> MetricObject*                             |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n                            |\n                            v\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| MetricObject                                             |\n|----------------------------------------------------------|\n| field_dict                                               |\n| series_map        : encoded_tag_set -> SeriesKey         |\n| series_keys       : series_id -> SeriesKey*              |\n| index             : optional tag filter index            |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n                            |\n                            v\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| SeriesKey                                                |\n|----------------------------------------------------------|\n| DataPointSet* + series_id + hash_code + encoded tag set  |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n                            |\n                            v\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| DataPointSet                                             |\n|----------------------------------------------------------|\n| SimpleDataPointSet or MultiFieldDataPointSet             |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
