      "text": "SeriesKey Inline\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+------------------+\n| data_point     | series_id  | hash_code      | tag_set_size   | tag_set_str      |\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+------------------+\n|<---- 8 B ----->|<--- 4 B -->|<---- 8 B ----->|<---- 4 B ----->|<- tag_set_size ->|",
