      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SeriesKey Skeleton\n// 写入或查找时先构造 skeleton key，不拥有 encoded tag set，只引用外部字符串\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+----------------------+\n| data_point_    | series_id_ | hash_code_     | tag_set_size_  | external tag set ref |\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+----------------------+\n| nullptr        | INVALID    | 8 B            | 4 B            | no inline ownership  |",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SeriesKey Skeleton\n// 写入或查找时先构造 skeleton key，不拥有 encoded tag set，只引用外部字符串\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+----------------------+\n| data_point_    | series_id_ | hash_code_     | tag_set_size_  | external tag set ref |\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+----------------------+\n| nullptr        | INVALID    | 8 B            | 4 B            | no inline ownership  |",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "T8FAdaT4HmmeKMTGFOpx8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4038.9760335286483,
      "y": -41.32986111111131,
      "width": 739.198974609375,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 525914605,
      "version": 153,
      "versionNonce": 1766427757,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790896409,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "series_map node\n\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+------------------+\n| data_point     | series_id  | hash_code      | tag_set_size   | encoded tag set  |\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+------------------+\n       |               |\n       |               +-----------------------------+\n       v                                             |\nDataPointSet                                         |\n                                                     v\nseries_keys[series_id_] --------------------> same SeriesKey",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "series_map node\n\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+------------------+\n| data_point     | series_id  | hash_code      | tag_set_size   | encoded tag set  |\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+------------------+\n       |               |\n       |               +-----------------------------+\n       v                                             |\nDataPointSet                                         |\n                                                     v\nseries_keys[series_id_] --------------------> same SeriesKey",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EqyN90s_7yEeJBHvrqSZR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2365.3228352864608,
      "y": 111.83420138888869,
      "width": 633.59912109375,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2083512355,
      "version": 93,
      "versionNonce": 1270385549,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784791022388,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ChainedArray 分列存储\n+---------------------------+------------------------------------------+\n| metric type               | DataPointSet implementation              |\n+---------------------------+------------------------------------------+\n| single-value metric       | SimpleDataPointSet<ts_offset_bytes, T>   |\n| multi-value metric        | MultiFieldDataPointSet<ts_offset_bytes>  |\n+---------------------------+------------------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ChainedArray 分列存储\n+---------------------------+------------------------------------------+\n| metric type               | DataPointSet implementation              |\n+---------------------------+------------------------------------------+\n| single-value metric       | SimpleDataPointSet<ts_offset_bytes, T>   |\n| multi-value metric        | MultiFieldDataPointSet<ts_offset_bytes>  |\n+---------------------------+------------------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TyKpsRTNbNRODDUcJ1h6T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2115.9170939127634,
      "y": 372.71831597222274,
      "width": 615.9991455078125,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 436418563,
      "version": 208,
      "versionNonce": 273746541,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785156712335,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ChainedArray<T> 分块数组，最新 block 挂在 `head_->prev`\n+----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+\n| head_          | size_          | latest_size_   | BLOCK_SIZE     |\n+----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+\n       |\n       v\n+----------------+---------------------------------------------------+\n| Node* prev     | no values payload in head node                    |\n+----------------+---------------------------------------------------+\n       |\n       v\n+----------------+-------------------------------+\n| Node* prev     | values[0 .. BLOCK_SIZE - 1]   |\n+----------------+-------------------------------+\n|<---- 8 B ----->|<------ sizeof(T) * N -------->|\n       |\n       v\n+----------------+-------------------------------+\n| Node* prev     | values[0 .. BLOCK_SIZE - 1]   |\n+----------------+-------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ChainedArray<T> 分块数组，最新 block 挂在 `head_->prev`\n+----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+\n| head_          | size_          | latest_size_   | BLOCK_SIZE     |\n+----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+\n       |\n       v\n+----------------+---------------------------------------------------+\n| Node* prev     | no values payload in head node                    |\n+----------------+---------------------------------------------------+\n       |\n       v\n+----------------+-------------------------------+\n| Node* prev     | values[0 .. BLOCK_SIZE - 1]   |\n+----------------+-------------------------------+\n|<---- 8 B ----->|<------ sizeof(T) * N -------->|\n       |\n       v\n+----------------+-------------------------------+\n| Node* prev     | values[0 .. BLOCK_SIZE - 1]   |\n+----------------+-------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8QtO8J8OpoA6CR6XqJOB6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2827.279642740889,
      "y": 380.3680555555562,
      "width": 686.3990478515625,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 825824045,
      "version": 68,
      "versionNonce": 1424321955,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785156734020,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MultiFieldDataPointSet<T>\n+----------------+----------------+------------------------------------------+\n| allocator_     | std_allocator_ | field_map_                               |\n+----------------+----------------+------------------------------------------+\n                                  |\n                                  v\n                   std::map<int16_t, DataPointSet*>\n\n+------------+--------------------+\n| field_id   | DataPointSet*      |\n+------------+--------------------+\n| field 1    | SimpleDPS<T, type> |\n| field 2    | SimpleDPS<T, type> |\n| field 7    | SimpleDPS<T, type> |\n+------------+--------------------+",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
